This license covers the source code and documentation in this repository.

It does not cover the release gate corpora. Those are third-party published works
and are deliberately not redistributed here: `gates/corpora/` is ignored, and
what is committed is a list of URLs, the fetcher, and per-rule counts. Building a
corpus locally leaves you holding somebody else's text under whatever terms they
publish it; MIT on this repository does not relicense it. See `gates/README.md`.
